# Shenjing

id:world-shenjing a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Shenjing" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4b996bd9cc16c> ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "Sigma Draconis, 19 ly, and the most crowded system recorded here: Sophic, Zoeific and Keterist orientations are common alongside the non-aligned, and every major Sephirotic empire except the Caretaker Gods holds something. Its worlds divide further than this map goes — Zhuque is cosmopolitan, Xuanwu is Keter's with Deeper Covenant communities in orbit, Baihu is mainly Zoeific and Sophic, and the Lagrange nodes of each are claimed separately again. Only the three commonest are drawn." ;
    oa:systemName "Shenjing" ;
    oa:uncertain false .

